#: ../../functions/func_strip.rst:6
msgid "$strip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_strip.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$strip(text)**"
msgstr "用法：**$strip(text)**"

#: ../../functions/func_strip.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_strip.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_strip.rst:13
msgid "Replaces all whitespace in ``text`` with a single space, and removes leading and trailing spaces. Whitespace characters include multiple consecutive spaces, and various other unicode characters. Characters such as newlines '\\\\n', tabs '\\\\t' and returns '\\\\r' are treated as spaces."
msgstr ""
"用单个空格替换 ``text`` 中的所有空白字符，并删除开头和结尾的空格。空白字符包"
"括多个连续的空格以及各种其他 Unicode 字符。换行符 '\\\\n'、制表符 '\\\\t' 和"
"回车 '\\\\r' 被视为空格。"

#: ../../functions/func_strip.rst:16
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_strip.rst:18
msgid "The following statements will each return \"This text has been stripped.\":"
msgstr "以下语句将每个返回 \"This text has been stripped.\"："
